        "key": "E",
        "text": "13"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "D",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Walls and roof",
        "body": "The walls are a square of 4 small squares (2 by 2). Count the matches in it: 3 rows of 2 lying matches ($3 \\times 2 = 6$) and 3 columns of 2 standing matches ($3 \\times 2 = 6$), so 12 matches.\n\nThe roof has 3 more matches.\n\n$12 + 3 = 15$.\n\n**Answer: (D) 15**"
      },
      {
        "title": "Count around",
        "body": "Count the outside matches of the house: 3 roof matches, 2 on each side of the walls (4) and 2 on the bottom: 9. The inside cross has 4 matches, and the line under the roof has 2. $9 + 4 + 2 = 15$.\n\n**Answer: (D) 15**"
      }
    ],
