        "title": "Use the clues in order",
        "body": "Number the caves 1 to 5 from the left.\n\n- Only one neighbour means an end cave: Dodo and Pepe live in caves 1 and 5.\n- The caves with a triangle are 1 and 4. Cave 1 is taken, so Ritchi lives in cave 4.\n- Pepe lives next to Buro. If Pepe were in cave 5, Buro would be in cave 4, but that is Ritchi's. So Pepe is in cave 1 and Buro in cave 2 (the green cave has no tree ✓).\n- Dodo is in cave 5.\n\nOnly cave 3 is left for Fifi: the small yellow cave.\n\n**Answer: (C)**"
